~ start
It's not raining anymore.
But… everything is broken.
A kind person brought me here. They said I was safe now.
But where's Nanay?
Where's Tatay?
Where's Kuya Dodong, Noni, Ate Valerie and Kiki?
…
They told me to wait.
Waiting and waiting…
I've been waiting for a long time.
They said they were looking for my family.
I kept looking at every face that passed by. Maybe Nanay was carrying Kiki. Maybe Ate was holding Noni's hand. Maybe Tatay and Dodong were looking for me too.
But nobody came…
…
They said they're still looking for my family.
But… it's been a long time.
…
Tatay knows how to swim, doesn't he?
So why hasn't he come back yet?
…
I thought Tatay would always know what to do.
I thought Nanay would always be there when I woke up.
…
I don't understand.
…
It was my birthday.
I'm eight now…

OLLIE:
Nay…
Tay…
I'm eight now.
Please come get me.
…
I want to go home.
=> END